   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "Chef Barinov is woken up in Elena Pavlovna's bedroom by an early morning call from Lyova, who says he and his mother are worried because Barinov never came home. Embarrassed to tell the truth, the Chef claims he spent the night at the restaurant.",
   "gap": 0.8
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Совесть, дай поспать.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "lyova",
   "t": "Лёва, что тебе надо?",
   "gap": 0.55
